Fresh destination `src/arch/x86/include/asm/cpufeatures.rs` added from the
complete pinned Linux header. Object-like defines are represented as typed
constants with unchanged expressions and ordering; X86_BUG is a const function
preserving the macro calculation. The CONFIG_X86_32 branch is retained as a
target-architecture conditional. Provenance records the pinned revision,
architecture, and task ID.

Representative translation:
```diff
-#define NCAPINTS 22
+pub const NCAPINTS: usize = 22;
-#define X86_BUG(x) (NCAPINTS*32 + (x))
+pub const fn X86_BUG(x: usize) -> usize { NCAPINTS * 32 + x }
```
